[
  {
    "content_id": "10054001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;奉我们救主　神和我们的盼望基督耶稣之命，作基督耶稣使徒的保罗</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;写信给那因信主作我真儿子的提摩太。愿恩惠、怜悯、平安从父　神和我们主基督耶稣归与你！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我往马其顿去的时候，曾劝你仍住在以弗所，好嘱咐那几个人不可传异教，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;也不可听从荒渺无凭的话语和无穷的家谱；这等事只生辩论，并不发明　神在信上所立的章程。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;但命令的总归就是爱；这爱是从清洁的心和无亏的良心，无伪的信心生出来的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有人偏离这些，反去讲虚浮的话，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;想要作教法师，却不明白自己所讲说的所论定的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我们知道律法原是好的，只要人用得合宜；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因为律法不是为义人设立的，乃是为不法和不服的，不虔诚和犯罪的，不圣洁和恋世俗的，弑父母和杀人的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;行淫和亲男色的，抢人口和说谎话的，并起假誓的，或是为别样敌正道的事设立的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这是照着可称颂之　神交托我荣耀福音说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我感谢那给我力量的我们主基督耶稣，因他以我有忠心，派我服事他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我从前是亵渎　神的，逼迫人的，侮慢人的；然而我还蒙了怜悯，因我是不信不明白的时候而做的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;并且我主的恩是格外丰盛，使我在基督耶稣里有信心和爱心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;「基督耶稣降世，为要拯救罪人。」这话是可信的，是十分可佩服的。在罪人中我是个罪魁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;然而，我蒙了怜悯，是因耶稣基督要在我这罪魁身上显明他一切的忍耐，给后来信他得永生的人作榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;但愿尊贵、荣耀归与那不能朽坏、不能看见、永世的君王、独一的　神，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我儿提摩太啊，我照从前指着你的预言，将这命令交托你，叫你因此可以打那美好的仗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;常存信心和无亏的良心。有人丢弃良心，就在真道上如同船破坏了一般。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;其中有许米乃和亚历山大；我已经把他们交给撒但，使他们受责罚就不再谤渎了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我劝你，第一要为万人恳求、祷告、代求、祝谢；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;为君王和一切在位的，也该如此，使我们可以敬虔、端正、平安无事地度日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;这是好的，在　神我们救主面前可蒙悦纳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他愿意万人得救，明白真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为只有一位　神，在　神和人中间，只有一位中保，乃是降世为人的基督耶稣；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他舍自己作万人的赎价，到了时候，这事必证明出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我为此奉派作传道的，作使徒，作外邦人的师傅，教导他们相信，学习真道。我说的是真话，并不是谎言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我愿男人无忿怒，无争论，举起圣洁的手，随处祷告；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;又愿女人廉耻、自守，以正派衣裳为妆饰，不以编发、黄金、珍珠，和贵价的衣裳为妆饰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;只要有善行，这才与自称是敬　神的女人相宜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;女人要沉静学道，一味地顺服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我不许女人讲道，也不许她辖管男人，只要沉静。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因为先造的是亚当，后造的是夏娃，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;且不是亚当被引诱，乃是女人被引诱，陷在罪里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;然而，女人若常存信心、爱心，又圣洁自守，就必在生产上得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;「人若想要得监督的职分，就是羡慕善工。」这话是可信的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;作监督的，必须无可指责，只作一个妇人的丈夫，有节制，自守，端正，乐意接待远人，善于教导；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;不因酒滋事，不打人，只要温和，不争竞，不贪财；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;好好管理自己的家，使儿女凡事端庄顺服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;人若不知道管理自己的家，焉能照管　神的教会呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;初入教的不可作监督，恐怕他自高自大，就落在魔鬼所受的刑罚里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;监督也必须在教外有好名声，恐怕被人毁谤，落在魔鬼的网罗里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;作执事的，也是如此：必须端庄，不一口两舌，不好喝酒，不贪不义之财；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要存清洁的良心，固守真道的奥秘。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;这等人也要先受试验，若没有可责之处，然后叫他们作执事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;女执事也是如此：必须端庄，不说谗言，有节制，凡事忠心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;执事只要作一个妇人的丈夫，好好管理儿女和自己的家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因为善作执事的，自己就得到美好的地步，并且在基督耶稣里的真道上大有胆量。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我指望快到你那里去，所以先将这些事写给你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;倘若我耽延日久，你也可以知道在　神的家中当怎样行。这家就是永生　神的教会，真理的柱石和根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;大哉，敬虔的奥秘，无人不以为然！ 就是　神在肉身显现， 被圣灵称义， 被天使看见， 被传于外邦， 被世人信服， 被接在荣耀里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;圣灵明说，在后来的时候，必有人离弃真道，听从那引诱人的邪灵和鬼魔的道理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这是因为说谎之人的假冒；这等人的良心如同被热铁烙惯了一般。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他们禁止嫁娶，又禁戒食物，就是　神所造、叫那信而明白真道的人感谢着领受的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;凡　神所造的物都是好的，若感谢着领受，就没有一样可弃的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;都因　神的道和人的祈求成为圣洁了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你若将这些事提醒弟兄们，便是基督耶稣的好执事，在真道的话语和你向来所服从的善道上得了教育。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;只是要弃绝那世俗的言语和老妇荒谬的话，在敬虔上操练自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;「操练身体，益处还少；惟独敬虔，凡事都有益处，因有今生和来生的应许。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;这话是可信的，是十分可佩服的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们劳苦努力，正是为此，因我们的指望在乎永生的　神；他是万人的救主，更是信徒的救主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这些事，你要吩咐人，也要教导人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不可叫人小看你年轻，总要在言语、行为、爱心、信心、清洁上，都作信徒的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要以宣读、劝勉、教导为念，直等到我来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你不要轻忽所得的恩赐，就是从前借着预言、在众长老按手的时候赐给你的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这些事你要殷勤去做，并要在此专心，使众人看出你的长进来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你要谨慎自己和自己的教训，要在这些事上恒心；因为这样行，又能救自己，又能救听你的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;不可严责老年人，只要劝他如同父亲；劝少年人如同弟兄；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;劝老年妇女如同母亲；劝少年妇女如同姊妹；总要清清洁洁的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;要尊敬那真为寡妇的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;若寡妇有儿女，或有孙子孙女，便叫他们先在自己家中学着行孝，报答亲恩，因为这在　神面前是可悦纳的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那独居无靠、真为寡妇的，是仰赖　神，昼夜不住地祈求祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;但那好宴乐的寡妇正活着的时候也是死的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;这些事你要嘱咐她们，叫她们无可指责。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;人若不看顾亲属，就是背了真道，比不信的人还不好，不看顾自己家里的人，更是如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;寡妇记在册子上，必须年纪到六十岁，从来只作一个丈夫的妻子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;又有行善的名声，就如养育儿女，接待远人，洗圣徒的脚，救济遭难的人，竭力行各样善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;至于年轻的寡妇，就可以辞她；因为她们的情欲发动，违背基督的时候就想要嫁人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;她们被定罪，是因废弃了当初所许的愿；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;并且她们又习惯懒惰，挨家闲游；不但是懒惰，又说长道短，好管闲事，说些不当说的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以我愿意年轻的寡妇嫁人，生养儿女，治理家务，不给敌人辱骂的把柄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因为已经有转去随从撒但的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;信主的妇女，若家中有寡妇，自己就当救济她们，不可累着教会，好使教会能救济那真无倚靠的寡妇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那善于管理教会的长老，当以为配受加倍的敬奉；那劳苦传道教导人的，更当如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因为经上说：「牛在场上踹谷的时候，不可笼住它的嘴」；又说：「工人得工价是应当的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;控告长老的呈子，非有两三个见证就不要收。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;犯罪的人，当在众人面前责备他，叫其余的人也可以惧怕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我在　神和基督耶稣并蒙拣选的天使面前嘱咐你：要遵守这些话，不可存成见，行事也不可有偏心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;给人行按手的礼，不可急促；不要在别人的罪上有分，要保守自己清洁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;因你胃口不清，屡次患病，再不要照常喝水，可以稍微用点酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;有些人的罪是明显的，如同先到审判案前；有些人的罪是随后跟了去的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;这样，善行也有明显的，那不明显的也不能隐藏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;凡在轭下作仆人的，当以自己主人配受十分的恭敬，免得　神的名和道理被人亵渎。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;仆人有信道的主人，不可因为与他是弟兄就轻看他；更要加意服事他；因为得服事之益处的，是信道蒙爱的。 你要以此教训人，劝勉人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;若有人传异教，不服从我们主耶稣基督纯正的话与那合乎敬虔的道理，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他是自高自大，一无所知，专好问难，争辩言词，从此就生出嫉妒、纷争、毁谤、妄疑，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;并那坏了心术、失丧真理之人的争竞。他们以敬虔为得利的门路。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;然而，敬虔加上知足的心便是大利了；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为我们没有带什么到世上来，也不能带什么去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;只要有衣有食，就当知足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但那些想要发财的人，就陷在迷惑、落在网罗和许多无知有害的私欲里，叫人沉在败坏和灭亡中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;贪财是万恶之根。有人贪恋钱财，就被引诱离了真道，用许多愁苦把自己刺透了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;但你这属　神的人要逃避这些事，追求公义、敬虔、信心、爱心、忍耐、温柔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你要为真道打那美好的仗，持定永生。你为此被召，也在许多见证人面前，已经作了那美好的见证。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我在叫万物生活的　神面前，并在向本丢·彼拉多作过那美好见证的基督耶稣面前嘱咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;要守这命令，毫不玷污，无可指责，直到我们的主耶稣基督显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;到了日期，那可称颂、独有权能的万王之王、万主之主，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;就是那独一不死、住在人不能靠近的光里，是人未曾看见、也是不能看见的，要将他显明出来。但愿尊贵和永远的权能都归给他。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你要嘱咐那些今世富足的人，不要自高，也不要倚靠无定的钱财；只要倚靠那厚赐百物给我们享受的　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;又要嘱咐他们行善，在好事上富足，甘心施舍，乐意供给人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;为自己积成美好的根基，预备将来，叫他们持定那真正的生命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;提摩太啊，你要保守所托付你的，躲避世俗的虚谈和那敌真道、似是而非的学问。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;已经有人自称有这学问，就偏离了真道。 愿恩惠常与你们同在！</p>"
  }
]